    intro: ['The OSRS Slayer Calculator turns a progression goal into kills using the XP awarded by the assigned target. For ordinary tasks this is closely tied to monster Hitpoints, but bosses, superior creatures, group encounters, shared damage, and special assignments can differ.', 'The starting 100 XP per kill is an explicit scenario prompt, not a claim about a named monster. Replace it with the linked task target’s actual Slayer XP before treating the kill count as useful.'],
