    mechanics: ['The canonical level formula gives XP remaining. Kills are ceiling(remaining XP ÷ Slayer XP per credited kill), and hours are kills divided by the entered rate.', 'The engine does not assume task streak points, bracelets, skips, block lists, superior spawns, or a Slayer master because those change planning around the kill calculation rather than the basic division.'],
    example: ['If 50,000 Slayer XP remains and the verified target awards 125 Slayer XP per credited kill, 400 kills are required. At 80 credited kills per hour, the simple combat-time estimate is five hours.'],
    result: ['Use the kill total to estimate task count only after considering average assignment size. Open DPS for encounter speed and Drop Rate for a separate item-probability goal; neither changes Slayer XP automatically.'],
    limits: ['Some kills split credit, award bonus XP, have phase damage, or occur off task. Bursting stacks, cannon damage, partner Slayer, superiors, and boss alternatives need session-derived XP and kill rates.'],
    referenceData: { title: 'Slayer planner units', note: 'Use one monster-specific XP record per scenario.', headers: ['Input', 'Unit', 'Where to verify'], rows: [['Current progress', 'Total Slayer XP', 'Skills interface'], ['Target', 'Skill level', 'XP table'], ['Reward', 'Slayer XP/kill', 'Monster page'], ['Speed', 'Credited kills/hour', 'Observed trip']] },
    sources: [xpSource, { label: 'OSRS Wiki — Slayer experience', url: 'https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Slayer#Experience' }],
